{"4733930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Car-Seat Angel", "steam_appid": 4733930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car-Seat Angel is a short narrative focused game that constantly swaps between its slow paced story and fast paced gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about breaking into heaven, illustrated with hand drawn art, animations and cutscenes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven levels each with new characters, environments and game-mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced gameplay. Swap from dodging and parrying enemies’ attacks in a top-down view to shooting them down in first person. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability with a time trials mode, completion ranks and optional challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car-Seat Angel is a short narrative focused game that constantly swaps between its slow paced story and fast paced gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about breaking into heaven, illustrated with hand drawn art, animations and cutscenes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven levels each with new characters, environments and game-mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced gameplay. Swap from dodging and parrying enemies’ attacks in a top-down view to shooting them down in first person. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability with a time trials mode, completion ranks and optional challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_d